newscache (1.3.18-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Authentication: missing optional fields no longer crash the session
    ("Authentication unix" or "pam" alone, short auth-file lines)
  * MD5 auth-file hashes no longer crash the session on 64-bit systems
  * DATE, NEWGROUPS: use gmtime_r/localtime_r and check the result

