newscache (1.3.17-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New maintainer; development continues at
    https://github.com/go-while/NewsCache
  * Access list: a Client entry with a plain address and no mask matched
    every client; exact-host entries (/32, /128) never matched
  * Keep the running config when a SIGHUP reload fails
  * Accept upstream articles without an Xref header
  * Fix the month in log file timestamps
  * Protocol fixes: CRLF after the access-denied reply, no NUL byte after
    "400 too many users"
  * Fix make check and add end-to-end tests

